55,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Candidate D offers the reporting simplicity of software, though I miss the independent verification of Candidate B.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Candidate D is a financial tool for back-office operations. This matches our most profitable exit profiles perfectly.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Candidate D avoids the equipment costs of B and C, and unlike A, it doesn't seem to require the same medical security hurdles.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Candidate D is software, but we are already full on software board seats! But wait, A and C need those hard-to-find supervisors!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Candidate A has medical records, meaning a three-quarter delay. Candidate B and C have hardware/logistics risks. Candidate D is the cleanest.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Mio, we may have to endure the board seat burden to avoid the audit nightmare of Candidate C's depots.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, I agree. D is the most logical choice based on exit history and retention patterns for financial tools.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Minako,,"I support D. It protects our reserves from the ""equipment trap"" I discovered.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Mio,,I guess D is better than spending four months looking for a shift supervisor for Candidate C!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Toshio,,D avoids the controller shortages of B and the security reviews of A. It is the most reliable.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Servas,,I am convinced. The peace of mind at quarter-end is worth the board seat pressure.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Asuka,,The logic is consistent across all our concerns.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Minako,,I agree.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Mio,,Me too! Let's go with D!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Toshio,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
